---
/**
 * Robonix Playground。
 *
 * 浏览器在这里是**机器人的身体**：它提供 primitive（底盘、机械臂、相机、
 * 扬声器），并显示运行时报回来的 RTDL 计划树。规划和执行属于服务器上的
 * pilot / executor —— 连不上时才退回本地兜底，页面永远不会是死屏。
 */
import Base from '@/layouts/Base.astro';
import { PROVENANCE as P } from '@/lib/lab/provenance';
---

<Base
  title="Robonix Playground"
  description="A browser-side robot body for Robonix: typed capabilities, a live RTDL plan tree, and a robot that actually does the chore."
>
  <h1 class="page-title">Robonix Playground</h1>
  <p class="page-lede">
    The browser is the robot's <b>body</b> — it provides the chassis, arm, camera and
    speaker as <a href="https://github.com/syswonder/robonix">Robonix</a> capabilities.
    Planning and execution belong to the runtime; this page shows you the plan tree it
    produces and runs. Ask it to do a chore — any language works.
  </p>

  <div class="lab" id="lab">
    <div class="lab-stage">
      <canvas id="lab-canvas"></canvas>
      <div class="bubble" id="lab-bubble" hidden></div>
      <div class="lab-hud" id="lab-hud" hidden><span class="lab-hud-dot"></span><span id="lab-hud-text"></span></div>
      <button class="lab-mute" id="lab-mute" type="button" title="Mute sound effects" aria-label="Mute sound effects">♪</button>
      <div class="lab-cam-float">
        <span class="lab-cam-tag">robot camera</span>
        <img id="lab-cam-img" alt="What the robot sees" />
      </div>
      <p class="lab-nogl">
        This demo needs WebGL, which this browser has turned off or can't start.
        The plan tree below still works.
      </p>
    </div>

    <form class="lab-ask" id="lab-ask">
      <input
        id="lab-input" type="text" autocomplete="off"
        placeholder="Cook me dinner…" aria-label="Ask the robot to do something" />
      <button type="submit" id="lab-go">Run</button>
    </form>

    <p class="lab-examples" id="lab-examples"></p>
    <p class="lab-note" id="lab-status">Ready.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="lab-panels">
    <section class="lab-block lab-plan">
      <h2>Plan <span class="lab-mode" id="lab-mode"></span></h2>
      <div class="rtdl" id="lab-rtdl">
        <p class="lab-empty">Ask for something and the plan tree appears here.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="lab-block">
      <h2>World</h2>
      <pre class="lab-state" id="lab-state"></pre>
    </section>
  </div>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Robonix exposes everything as <b>capabilities</b>, identified by contract IDs.
        This page provides capabilities across all four layers, using the contract names
        that actually exist in the repository:
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>
          <b>primitive</b> — hardware. <code>chassis/move</code>,
          <code>arm/pos_command</code>, <code>arm/joint_command</code>,
          <code>arm/end_pose</code>, <code>camera/snapshot</code>,
          <code>audio/speaker</code>. Here the browser <em>is</em> the hardware: each one
          is an animation that resolves when the motion finishes, which is how the
          executor learns a step is done.
        </li>
        <li>
          <b>service</b> — shared infrastructure. <code>navigation/navigate</code> plans a
          collision-free path (A* over an occupancy grid built from the furniture) and
          then drives; <code>speech/speak</code> talks.
        </li>
        <li>
          <b>system</b> — <code>scene/list_objects</code>,
          <code>scene/get_object_context</code>, <code>scene/get_robot_context</code>.
          The semantic map. Finding something is a scene query, not a camera call — the
          camera contract only returns frames.
        </li>
        <li>
          <b>skill</b> — deployment-specific behaviour, the one layer where custom
          contracts are legitimate: <code>kitchen/cook</code>, <code>kitchen/wash</code>,
          <code>houseplant/water</code>.
        </li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        Note there is no <code>grasp</code> primitive, because Robonix doesn't define one.
        The gripper is a named joint, so picking something up is four steps —
        navigate, locate it in the scene graph, move the end effector, close
        <code>gripper_finger_joint</code>. Composing that is exactly what a skill is for.
      </p>
      <p>
        A plan is an <b>RTDL</b> tree — Robot Task Description Language, the format the
        pilot asks the model for. Only three node types exist: <code>sequence</code>
        (ordered, fail-fast), <code>parallel</code> (concurrent, a failing branch doesn't
        cancel its siblings), and <code>do</code> (call one capability). The tree updates
        live as it is walked.
      </p>
      <p>
        The model only ever <em>proposes</em> a tree. Capability names and arguments are
        checked against the catalog, and preconditions are checked before anything moves —
        ask it to close the gripper on nothing and the step goes red with the reason.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <h2>What's actually running</h2>
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        Demos like this are easy to be vague about, so here is the exact provenance.
      </p>
    </div>
    <dl class="prov">
      <div>
        <dt>Model</dt>
        <dd>
          <strong class="prov-model">{P.vlm.model}</strong>
          <span class="prov-dim">{P.vlm.vendor} · {P.vlm.modalities}</span>
          <span class="prov-dim">{P.vlm.endpoint}</span>
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Robonix</dt>
        <dd>
          <a href={P.robonix.repo}>{P.robonix.version}</a>
          <span class="prov-dim">{P.robonix.commit} · {P.robonix.date}</span>
        </dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Components</dt>
        <dd>{P.components.join(' · ')}</dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Host</dt>
        <dd>{P.host.name} <span class="prov-dim">{P.host.arch}</span></dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>OS</dt>
        <dd>{P.host.distro} <span class="prov-dim">kernel {P.host.kernel}</span></dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Toolchain</dt>
        <dd>rustc {P.host.rustc} <span class="prov-dim">· python {P.host.python}</span></dd>
      </div>
      <div>
        <dt>Browser</dt>
        <dd>
          {P.browserRole}
          <ul class="prov-providers">
            {P.browserProviders.map((p) => (
              <li>
                <code>{p.id}</code>
                <span class="prov-layer">{p.layer}</span>
                <span class="prov-dim">{p.caps} caps · {p.note}</span>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ul>
        </dd>
      </div>
    </dl>
    <p class="prose prov-role">{P.vlm.role}</p>
    <p class="prov-note" id="prov-note"></p>
  </section>
</Base>

<script>
  import { LabWorld } from '@/lib/lab/world';
  import { makePrimitives, CATALOG } from '@/lib/lab/primitives';
  import { planLocally, runLocally } from '@/lib/lab/local-fallback';
  import {
    renderEnvelope, renderNode, fromWirePlan, applyNodeState,
    countLeaves, type RtdlEnvelope, type RtdlNode,
  } from '@/lib/lab/rtdl';
  import { OBJECTS, PLACES } from '@/lib/lab/scene-spec';
  import { sfx, setSfxEnabled, sfxEnabled, unlockAudioOnce } from '@/lib/lab/sfx';
  import { RobonixLink, defaultLinkBase } from '@/lib/lab/robonix-link';
  import { AgentClient, type AgentEvent } from '@/lib/lab/agent-client';
  // 模型名只有一处真相：provenance。页面上写死过一次，换模型时就对不上了。
  import { PROVENANCE } from '@/lib/lab/provenance';
  const VLM_MODEL = PROVENANCE.vlm.model;

  const EXAMPLES = [
    'Cook me dinner',
    'Tidy up',
    'Water the plant',
    'Wash the dishes',
    'Bring me the book',
    'Throw away the wrapper',
    'Grab the mug',           // 没先看就抓 —— 演示被运行时拒绝
  ];

  const canvas = document.getElementById('lab-canvas') as HTMLCanvasElement | null;
  if (canvas) {
    try { boot(canvas); }
    catch (e) {
      console.warn('[playground] WebGL unavailable:', e);
      document.getElementById('lab')?.classList.add('is-nogl');
      const s = document.getElementById('lab-status');
      if (s) s.textContent = 'WebGL unavailable — the 3D view is disabled.';
    }
  }

  function boot(canvas: HTMLCanvasElement) {
    const bubble   = document.getElementById('lab-bubble')!;
    const camImg   = document.getElementById('lab-cam-img') as HTMLImageElement;
    const rtdlEl   = document.getElementById('lab-rtdl')!;
    const stateEl  = document.getElementById('lab-state')!;
    const statusEl = document.getElementById('lab-status')!;
    const modeEl   = document.getElementById('lab-mode')!;
    const exEl     = document.getElementById('lab-examples')!;
    const form     = document.getElementById('lab-ask') as HTMLFormElement;
    const input    = document.getElementById('lab-input') as HTMLInputElement;
    const goBtn    = document.getElementById('lab-go') as HTMLButtonElement;

    const hud = document.getElementById('lab-hud')!;
    const hudText = document.getElementById('lab-hud-text')!;
    const muteBtn = document.getElementById('lab-mute') as HTMLButtonElement;

    unlockAudioOnce();

    const world = new LabWorld(canvas, {
      onSay(text) {
        if (text) { bubble.textContent = text; bubble.hidden = false; speak(text); }
        else bubble.hidden = true;
      },
      // 每个动作在 3D 视图里给个回显，不然只能盯着树猜现在在干嘛
      onAction(label) {
        if (label) { hudText.textContent = label; hud.hidden = false; }
        else hud.hidden = true;
      },
    });

    muteBtn.addEventListener('click', () => {
      const on = !sfxEnabled();
      setSfxEnabled(on);
      muteBtn.textContent = on ? '♪' : '✕';
      muteBtn.classList.toggle('is-off', !on);
    });
    const prims = makePrimitives(world);
    let busy = false;
    let env: RtdlEnvelope | null = null;

    /* ==================================================================
       接上真的 Robonix
       ==================================================================

       三条 WebSocket 让服务器上的三个 provider 把这个网页当成机器人的身体，
       第四条把用户输入的一句话交给 pilot。四条都通了才算「live」——
       任何一条断了就如实降级到浏览器本地的规则规划，并且**在界面上说清楚**。
       演示里最不该做的事就是让人以为跑的是真的。 */

    const provNote = document.getElementById('prov-note');

    const link = new RobonixLink(world, { base: defaultLinkBase() }, {
      onState: () => refreshMode(),
      // 服务器每调一次能力就在 HUD 上闪一下，让「这是远程驱动的」看得见
      onCall: (op) => { hudText.textContent = op; hud.hidden = false; },
      onResult: () => { hud.hidden = true; },
    });

    let agentState: 'connecting' | 'online' | 'offline' = 'connecting';
    const agent = new AgentClient(
      `${defaultLinkBase()}/agent`,
      onAgentEvent,
      (s) => { agentState = s; refreshMode(); },
    );

    /** 现在到底是 live 还是 fallback —— 这个判断只有一处 */
    function isLive() { return link.online && agentState === 'online'; }

    function refreshMode() {
      if (isLive()) {
        modeEl.textContent = `live · ${VLM_MODEL}`;
        modeEl.classList.add('is-live');
        modeEl.title =
          'Connected to the Robonix runtime on dedsec-amd0. This page is registered with '
          + `Atlas as three capability providers; the plan below comes from ${VLM_MODEL} `
          + 'through pilot, and every motion is an executor dispatch.';
        if (provNote) {
          provNote.textContent =
            'This page is currently attached to that runtime. The browser registers with Atlas '
            + 'as browser_sim (primitive), browser_nav (service) and browser_scene (system), so '
            + 'the robot you see is a real capability provider rather than a viewer.';
        }
      } else {
        const why = !link.online
          ? 'the robot body could not attach to the runtime'
          : 'the planner is unreachable';
        modeEl.textContent = 'local fallback';
        modeEl.classList.remove('is-live');
        modeEl.title = `Not connected — ${why}. Planning and execution are running in the browser.`;
        if (provNote) {
          provNote.textContent =
            `The runtime lives on that host, but this page is not attached right now (${why}). `
            + 'Planning and execution have fallen back to a rule-based planner running in the '
            + 'browser, which is why the plan panel is labelled “local fallback”. '
            + 'It reconnects on its own.';
        }
      }
    }
    refreshMode();
    link.start();
    agent.connect();

    /* --------------------------------------------------------- 语音
       用浏览器自带的 TTS，参数保持中性，优先保证**各平台都能出声**。

       跨平台的坑主要是两个，这里都处理了：
         · Chrome 的 getVoices() 首次是空的，要等 voiceschanged 事件；
           所以不在启动时锁定音色，而是每次说话时现取。
         · 各平台音色名字完全不同（Samantha 只有 macOS 有），
           写死名字在别的系统上就是没有。所以只按语言挑，挑不到就
           交给浏览器自己决定 —— 那一定是能用的。 */
    function pickVoice(): SpeechSynthesisVoice | null {
      const vs = speechSynthesis.getVoices();
      if (!vs.length) return null;                 // 还没加载好，交给浏览器默认
      return vs.find((v) => /^en[-_]?US/i.test(v.lang) && v.localService)
          ?? vs.find((v) => /^en/i.test(v.lang) && v.localService)
          ?? vs.find((v) => /^en/i.test(v.lang))
          ?? null;
    }

    function speak(text: string) {
      try {
        if (!('speechSynthesis' in window)) return;
        const u = new SpeechSynthesisUtterance(text);
        u.lang = 'en-US';
        const v = pickVoice();
        if (v) u.voice = v;                        // 挑不到就用浏览器默认，不强求
        // 中性参数：不做任何风格化，优先听清
        u.rate = 1;
        u.pitch = 1;
        u.volume = 1;
        speechSynthesis.cancel();
        speechSynthesis.speak(u);
      } catch {
        /* 不支持 TTS 的浏览器：气泡还在，功能不受影响 */
      }
    }

    /* --------------------------------------------------------- 示例 */
    EXAMPLES.forEach((label, i) => {
      if (i) exEl.append(' · ');
      const b = document.createElement('button');
      b.type = 'button'; b.className = 'lab-ex'; b.textContent = label;
      b.addEventListener('click', () => { input.value = label; submit(label); });
      exEl.appendChild(b);
    });

    /* --------------------------------------------------------- 渲染 */
    function drawPlan() {
      rtdlEl.innerHTML = env ? renderEnvelope(env) : '<p class="lab-empty">Ask for something.</p>';
    }

    function drawState() {
      const s = world.snapshot();
      const rows = [
        `at        ${s.at}`,
        `holding   ${s.holding ?? '—'}`,
        '',
        ...Object.entries(s.where)
          .sort()
          .map(([k, v]) => `${k.padEnd(9)} ${v === OBJECTS[k as keyof typeof OBJECTS]?.home ? v : v + '  *'}`),
        '',
        '* not in its usual place',
      ];
      stateEl.textContent = rows.join('\n');
    }

    /* ================================================== 服务器推来的计划 */

    /*
      pilot 每一轮都发一棵新树（它会边做边改计划），所以这里保留最近几轮，
      让人看得到它是怎么改主意的 —— 那恰恰是这套系统最值得看的部分。
    */
    type Round = { round: number; say: string; tree: RtdlNode | null };
    let rounds: Round[] = [];
    let liveGoal = '';

    function drawLivePlan() {
      if (!rounds.length) {
        rtdlEl.innerHTML = '<p class="lab-empty">Ask for something.</p>';
        return;
      }
      const html = rounds.map((r) => {
        const total = r.tree ? countLeaves(r.tree) : 0;
        return (
          (r.say ? `<p class="rt-say">${escapeHtml(r.say)}</p>` : '') +
          `<div class="rt-head">` +
            `<span class="rt-summary">round ${r.round}</span>` +
            `<span class="rt-progress">${total} call${total === 1 ? '' : 's'}</span>` +
          `</div>` +
          (r.tree ? `<div class="rt-tree-body">${renderNode(r.tree)}</div>` : '')
        );
      }).join('');
      rtdlEl.innerHTML = html +
        (liveGoal ? `<p class="rt-goal"><span>goal</span> ${escapeHtml(liveGoal)}</p>` : '');
      rtdlEl.scrollTop = rtdlEl.scrollHeight;
    }

    function escapeHtml(s: string) {
      return String(s).replace(/[&<>"]/g, (c) =>
        ({ '&': '&amp;', '<': '&lt;', '>': '&gt;', '"': '&quot;' }[c]!));
    }

    let pendingText = '';

    function onAgentEvent(e: AgentEvent) {
      switch (e.kind) {
        case 'ready':
          break;

        case 'status':
          statusEl.className = 'lab-note';
          statusEl.textContent = e.message;
          break;

        case 'text':
          // pilot 是流式吐字的，攒到下一棵树出现时一并作为那一轮的开场白
          pendingText += e.text;
          statusEl.className = 'lab-note';
          statusEl.textContent = pendingText.slice(-160);
          break;

        case 'plan': {
          rounds.push({ round: e.round, say: pendingText.trim(), tree: fromWirePlan(e as any) });
          pendingText = '';
          if (rounds.length > 6) rounds = rounds.slice(-6);
          drawLivePlan();
          break;
        }

        case 'node': {
          for (const r of rounds) {
            if (r.tree && applyNodeState(r.tree, e)) break;
          }
          drawLivePlan();
          drawState();
          break;
        }

        case 'task':
          liveGoal = e.goal;
          drawLivePlan();
          break;

        case 'final':
          if (e.text) {
            statusEl.className = 'lab-note';
            statusEl.textContent = e.text;
            bubble.textContent = e.text;
            bubble.hidden = false;
            speak(e.text);
          }
          sfx.done();
          break;

        case 'error':
          statusEl.className = 'lab-note is-err';
          statusEl.textContent = e.message;
          sfx.reject();
          break;

        case 'idle':
          setBusy(false);
          break;
      }
    }

    function setBusy(b: boolean) {
      busy = b;
      goBtn.disabled = b;
      input.disabled = b;
      if (!b) input.focus();
    }

    /* --------------------------------------------------------- 执行 */
    async function submit(task: string) {
      if (busy || !task.trim()) return;

      /* ---- 真运行时 ---- */
      if (isLive()) {
        rounds = [];
        pendingText = '';
        liveGoal = task;
        drawLivePlan();
        statusEl.className = 'lab-note';
        statusEl.textContent = 'Sending to pilot…';
        setBusy(true);
        if (!agent.submit(task)) {
          statusEl.className = 'lab-note is-err';
          statusEl.textContent = 'Lost the connection to the planner. Falling back locally.';
          setBusy(false);
          refreshMode();
        }
        return;   // 剩下的全部由 onAgentEvent 驱动
      }

      /* ---- 本地兜底 ---- */
      statusEl.className = 'lab-note';
      statusEl.textContent = 'Planning…';

      const planned = planLocally(task, world.snapshot() as any);
      if (!planned) {
        statusEl.className = 'lab-note is-err';
        statusEl.textContent = "I couldn't turn that into a plan. Try one of the examples.";
        return;
      }

      setBusy(true);
      env = planned;
      drawPlan();
      statusEl.textContent = 'Running…';

      const res = await runLocally(env.rtdl, prims, { onUpdate: () => { drawPlan(); drawState(); } });

      if (res.ok) {
        env.task_update.status = 'succeeded';
        statusEl.className = 'lab-note';
        statusEl.textContent = 'Done.';
        sfx.done();
      } else {
        env.task_update.status = 'failed';
        statusEl.className = 'lab-note is-err';
        statusEl.textContent = `Stopped: ${res.error}`;
        sfx.reject();
      }
      drawPlan(); drawState();
      setBusy(false);
    }

    form.addEventListener('submit', (e) => { e.preventDefault(); submit(input.value); });

    /* --------------------------------------------------------- 相机 */
    setInterval(() => {
      try { camImg.src = world.captureRobotView(0.55); } catch { /* 尚未就绪 */ }
    }, 600);

    addEventListener('resize', () => world.resize());
    drawState();
    drawPlan();
  }
</script>

<style>
  .page-title {
    font-family: var(--font-sans);
    font-size: var(--fs-h1);
    font-weight: var(--fw-bold);
    letter-spacing: var(--ls-tight);
    margin: 0 0 var(--sp-3);
  }
  .page-lede {
    max-width: var(--w-prose);
    color: var(--text-muted);
    font-size: var(--fs-base);
    line-height: var(--lh-base);
    margin: 0 0 var(--sp-5);
  }

  /* ---- 舞台 ---- */
  .lab-stage { position: relative; }
  .lab-stage canvas {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg-subtle);
  }
  .lab-nogl { display: none; border: 1px solid var(--border); padding: var(--sp-5); color: var(--text-muted); }
  .lab.is-nogl canvas { display: none; }
  .lab.is-nogl .lab-nogl { display: block; }

  .bubble {
    position: absolute;
    left: var(--sp-3); top: var(--sp-3);
    max-width: 70%;
    background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    padding: var(--sp-2) var(--sp-3);
    font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    line-height: var(--lh-snug);
  }
  .bubble[hidden] { display: none; }

  /* ---- 输入 ---- */
  .lab-ask { display: flex; gap: var(--sp-2); margin-top: var(--sp-4); }
  .lab-ask input {
    flex: 1; min-width: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: var(--fs-base);
    color: var(--text); background: var(--bg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: var(--sp-2) var(--sp-3);
  }
  .lab-ask input:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--link); }
  .lab-ask button {
    font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: var(--fs-base);
    color: var(--bg); background: var(--text);
    border: 1px solid var(--text); border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: var(--sp-2) var(--sp-5); cursor: pointer;
  }
  .lab-ask button:disabled { opacity: 0.4; cursor: default; }

  .lab-examples { margin: var(--sp-3) 0 0; font-size: var(--fs-sm); color: var(--text-faint); line-height: var(--lh-base); }
  .lab-ex {
    font-family: var(--font-sans); font-size: var(--fs-sm);
    color: var(--link); background: none; border: 0; padding: 0; cursor: pointer;
  }
  .lab-ex:hover { color: var(--link-hover); text-decoration: underline; }

